---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { email, hasResume, linkedin, resumePath } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About · Ploypairaoh Pat" description="Computational and Data Science student at George Mason University, focused on data analysis and business decisions. Expected graduation: 2027." active="about">
  <header class="ph"><div class="read"><span class="eyebrow">About</span><h1>Analysis is the last mile before a decision.</h1></div></header>
  <div class="tape"></div>
  <main class="read"><div class="ab">
    <div>
      <p>I’m Pat Ploypairaoh, a Computational and Data Science student at George Mason University. I’m interested in using data to understand practical problems and communicate findings that people can act on.</p>
      <p>My projects include analyzing two years of audiovisual inventory records to identify tracking gaps and recommend improvements, and testing how well offline, text-based models assess misinformation risk. Alongside technical work, my experience with George Mason University Student Centers and student leadership has strengthened how I organize projects, work with others, and explain results.</p>
      <p>Outside my technical work, I served as president of a nearly 40-member Beta Theta Pi chapter. I introduced a budget to address a $5,000 inherited debt and earned unanimous chapter approval. As vice president of recruitment for George Mason’s Interfraternity Council, I helped introduce a shared recruiting system across 15 fraternities; more than 100 new members joined during its first semester.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="side">
      <div class="ccard"><div class="ct">Explore my work</div>
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>Email<span class="ar">↗</span></a>
        <a href={linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn<span class="ar">↗</span></a>
        <a href="https://github.com/PloypairaohPat" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub<span class="ar">↗</span></a>
        {hasResume && <a href={resumePath}>Resume</a>}
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div></main>
</Base>
